  "turns": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "I am a nurse on the surgical ward and I look after eight patients per shift.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "Mornings are rounds and medication, then charting, then calls to the lab for results.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "Charting happens twice, in the patient system and again in the ward spreadsheet, about 45 minutes every shift.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["T1"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "I phone the lab for blood results several times a shift and wait on the line.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["T2"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": "After the medication round I write what was given on paper and then enter it later.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["T3"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "At handover I write a summary by hand for the next nurse and read it out.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["T4"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "text": "Once a week I count the supply cupboard and order what is missing by email.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["T5"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "text": "Whenever a patient moves I update the bed status on the whiteboard and in the system.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["T6"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "text": "Results come from the lab by phone and I type them into the patient system by hand.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["I1"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "text": "Quick questions to the doctors go over WhatsApp because paging is slow.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["I2"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "text": "The double entry causes mistakes and nobody knows which number is right.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["P1"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "I wait for the lab most days, sometimes an hour, and the doctors wait for me.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": ["P2"],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
